# Files excluded from the Cloudflare Pages upload.
#
# CI deploys this directory (bg/) as the site root, so these patterns are
# resolved relative to bg/ — not to the repo root. Anything outside bg/ is
# never uploaded in the first place.
#
# Right now bg/ holds exactly the 4 runtime files and nothing to exclude.
# This is a safety net for later: drop a source image or mockup in here and
# it will stay out of the bundle without anyone remembering to move it.

# source art, never referenced by the page
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg
*.psd

# editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# in case a build step ever lands in here
node_modules/
.wrangler/
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml